OL,3,GNEWSARoad safety red routes plan to be
OL,4,Are-examined
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for an 18-month "red route" road
OL,7,Fsafety trial in Luton will be looked at
OL,8,Fagain by councillors.
OL,10,FLuton Borough Council proposed the
OL,11,Fscheme for Bury Park, which bans
OL,12,Fparking and loading, but opposition
OL,13,Fcouncillors have called in the
OL,14,Fdecision, including Lib Dem Lee
OL,15,FBridgen, who said there were issues in
OL,16,Fthe area, but "this doesn't establish
OL,17,Fconfidence a red route is the right
OL,18,Fsolution".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
