OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARoad safety red routes plan to be
OL,4,Are-examined
OL,5,
OL,6,FLabour councillor Javeria Hussain,
OL,7,Fportfolio holder for sustainable
OL,8,Ftransport, said: "We've received
OL,9,Fnumerous complaints about congestion
OL,10,Fand safety over many years."
OL,12,FPlans, which would also include
OL,13,Fautomatic number plate recognition
OL,14,F(ANPR), will be re-examined at a
OL,15,Fcouncil meeting on 3 September.
